node_modules/
*.tgz
.DS_Store
dist/

# `lib/` is intentionally COMMITTED: the documented install path is
# `dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:xx529/dsh-trace-inspect`, and a
# git-sourced plugin gets no build step unless it ships a `prepare` script
# (which pnpm may skip under its dependency build-script gate). Shipping the
# built halves keeps that install path working offline and deterministic.
# CI re-builds and runs `pnpm check:lib` (scripts/check-lib.mjs), which asserts
# lib/ is tracked AND identical to the fresh build — so the committed output
# cannot drift from src/.
